{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT WOULD YOU DO IN A UFO INVASION?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW ABOUT SPACEJACK A UFO AND TURN ALIEN TECH AGAINST THEM!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control, power up, and push back waves of space aliens in a fast, stage-based arcade fight for Earth. Blast through 49 stages of intensifying action as threats stack up and the sky gets meaner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a black hole to pull enemies into a vortex, nuke \u2019em back to the Stone Age, or flip the odds with slow-mo and invincibility when things get out of hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health boosts, speed boosts, and weapon upgrades keep you evolving, while Swarm Time and Asteroid Alerts force you to adapt on the fly. Save the planet\u2014one wave at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>49 stages of intensifying action</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves of space aliens to fight off</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space-age power-ups: black holes, nukes, slow-mo, and invincibility</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health, speed, and weapon upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Time events and Asteroid Alerts hazards</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2182940?t=1770997818","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770997818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182940/381b0d8565bf54998e83a281f063145f98848d24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770997818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182940/381b0d8565bf54998e83a281f063145f98848d24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770997818","categories":[{"desc